%% Diagramme de sequence - Affectation d'un bien (CU-05) - scenario nominal du CDC
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RS as Responsable structure
    actor GC as Gestionnaire central
    participant W as web-app
    participant G as api-gateway
    participant M as movement-service
    participant S as asset-service
    participant O as organisation-service
    participant D as document-service
    participant DBm as movement_db
    participant DBa as asset_db
    participant N as notification-service

    Note over RS: Pre-conditions : bien "Disponible", droit d'affectation
    RS->>W: Selectionne bien + structure destinataire + motif + pieces
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/movements (type=affectation)
    G->>M: Creation demande
    M->>S: GET /api/v1/assets/{id} (etat = Disponible ?)
    S-->>M: Bien disponible
    M->>O: GET /api/v1/structures/{dest}
    O-->>M: Structure destinataire valide
    M->>DBm: INSERT mouvement statut=En attente
    M->>N: Notification "demande a valider" -> Gestionnaire central
    N-->>GC: Alerte
    GC->>W: Ouvre la demande, consulte pieces
    W->>D: GET documents associes
    D-->>W: Pieces jointes
    GC->>W: Valide la demande
    W->>G: POST /api/v1/movements/{id}/validate
    G->>M: Validation
    M->>DBm: UPDATE statut=Validee
    M->>S: POST /api/v1/assets/{id}/affectation (structure_dest, site)
    S->>DBa: UPDATE asset : structure_id, statut=Affecte
    M->>N: Evenement "bien affecte" (RabbitMQ)
    N-->>RS: Notification affectation executee
    N-->>GC: Confirmation
    M-->>G: 200 OK
    G-->>W: Demande cloturee
    W-->>RS: Historique mis a jour
